<title>USA: Fidelity confirms asst head of equity div to leave.</title>
<headline>Fidelity confirms asst head of equity div to leave.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Investments on Monday confirmed a published report that Bart Grenier, the assistant head of the firm's stock division and former research chief, was leaving the nation's largest mutual fund company.</p>
<p>Grenier, who could not be reached for comment, was second to William Hayes, chief operating officer for equity investments, in the management of the group. Grenier's responsibilities included overseeing research, portfolio management and trading functions.</p>
<p>((--Boston bureau, 617-367-4106))</p>
